## Complexity Guidelines

| Size | Guideline |
|------|-----------|
| XS | Single function, obvious fix |
| S | Single file, straightforward logic |
| M | Multiple files, some complexity |
| L | Multiple components, significant logic |
| XL | Cross-cutting, architectural impact |

